\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Love is the key of life and death,
\par Of hidden heavenly mystery:
\par Of all Christ is, of all He saith,
\par Love is the key.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. As three times to His saint He saith,
\par He saith to me, He saith to thee.
\par Breathing His grace-conferring
\par Lovest thou Me?
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Ah, Lord, I have such feeble faith,
\par Such feeble hope to comfort me:
\par But love it is, is strong as death;
\par And I love Thee.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

